      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you are still even around, I should exclaim that the 'technology' you are describing is a principle of recognition of ownership, not any type of ownership enforceable by copyright law, licensing, or patent. NFT's are in most to all cases for profit, and the system you're wishing for is far more related to encryption and obfuscation, which requires coding rather than a system of virtual for-profit ownership to achieve.",
